AIP Website — Full Rebuild Blueprint for a 10/10 Experience

Kung ako ang magre-rebuild ng buong AIP website from scratch, hindi ko lang aayusin ang current UI. Gagawa ako ng isang complete, organized, premium partner-facing website system na malinaw ang purpose, madaling i-navigate, credible, at may malinaw na next step.

Ang goal:

Every section has one job. Every feature has a reason. Every visitor knows what AIP is, why it matters, whether they fit, and what to do next.

Hindi ibig sabihin na kailangan natin ng maraming pages o maraming animations. Ang 10/10 ay manggagaling sa clarity + consistency + trust + usability + execution.

Ang blueprint na ito ay based sa current AIP concept na may private invitation positioning, partner-focused content, tiers/categories/engagement models, compensation discussion, risk considerations, at invitation CTA. Ang mga bagong features sa ibaba ay proposed rebuild structure, hindi mga functionality na confirmed na existing sa file.

1. Core website architecture

Ito ang magiging main structure ko:

AIP Website

One coherent partner experience

Home / Overview

What AIP is, who it is for, and why the visitor should continue.

The Opportunity

What AIP is building, the problem, and the potential value.

Tracks / Contribution Areas

The different ways a partner can participate.

Structure / Engagement Models

How participation, tiers, responsibilities, and commercial arrangements work.

Risk & Transparency

Clear boundaries, assumptions, uncertainties, and non-guarantees.

Partner Journey

From invitation to review, discussion, agreement, and onboarding.

Invitation / Contact

A simple and reliable way to start a conversation.

Important: Hindi ibig sabihin na kailangan itong maging seven separate pages. Maaari itong maging one long-form website with clear anchored sections, provided na mahusay ang navigation, mobile experience, and information hierarchy.

