6. What I would NOT add

Para hindi maging makalat, ito ang mga bagay na iiwasan ko sa first version:

Random animations on every card.

Too many gradients and decorative motifs.

Unnecessary popup invitations.

Auto-playing background video.

A separate page for every short section.

Fake counters, fake testimonials, or invented partner logos.

A complicated registration system before the partner journey is validated.

Publicly exposing sensitive partner information.

A chat widget that has no actual support process behind it.

A “dashboard” that does not yet have a real use case.

Overly detailed legal claims without reviewed and approved wording.

A huge risk section before the visitor understands the actual opportunity.

Multiple competing primary buttons.

Hidden content that requires JavaScript to be visible.

Rule: If a feature does not improve understanding, trust, conversion, accessibility, or operations, it should not be included just for visual impact.

